/Title (In Seattle, tourism intensity exhibits little to no correlation with tourism call share \(0.01\) and only a weak relationship with tourism-related calls \(0.21\), despite strong correlations among tourism-related variables themselves. This suggests that tourism-related complaints in Seattle scale with overall activity but do not significantly increase their share of total 311 calls.)
